# Wave W17-V (Heritage Forest): silk log — a fallen silk-strung log section lying in the manor shade: a horizontal bark body with ringed cut ends and pale silk strands draped across it where the forest’s silk-kin have been (design: the manor garden’s fallen giants under the spare light). On deep turf (fully opaque, ground baked in) — split from Maris’s silkstrand prop by register: Borea’s log lies in dark manor shade, Maris’s strand hangs in bright silk shade; and from the fleet’s posts by form entire (a log lies, a post stands).
